# This repo is authored on Windows and executed on Linux (Docker, Colab, Kaggle).
# Normalise to LF in the repository so a checkout never hands the kernel a
# CRLF shebang line, which fails with "bad interpreter".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish artefacts: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.bin binary

# Generated; keep diffs collapsed in review.
uv.lock linguist-generated=true -diff
